! Test v1.09.1 (3/3): smeared opt+freq, fractional UKS with the
! RELAXED moment.  O2 HF/STO-3G, gauss sigma = 0.15 Ha, %mult 3.
! NOTE THE SEED: %mult 3, not 1 -- a relaxed-moment OPTIMIZATION
! seeded symmetrically (%mult 1) rides the Pa = Pb symmetric trap
! (v1.08.1) through the whole warm-started chain and optimizes on
! the M = 0 branch, 0.17 Ha ABOVE this M = 2.0 free-energy branch
! (cold starts escape via guess-level HOMO-LUMO mixing, warm
! restarts preserve Pa = Pb exactly).  Seed with the physical
! multiplicity.
! Expected (container reference): opt converges in 4 steps to
! R(O-O) = 1.21732176 A on the M = 1.998 branch,
! F = -147.634258690677 Ha; the stretch is
!   omega = 2083.84 cm-1  (semi-numerical route)
! Independent 5-point FD of F over %job energy at the optimum:
! center gradient 4e-8 Ha/bohr, omega = 2083.80 cm-1 (0.04 cm-1).
%method  HF
%basis   sto-3g
%job     opt+freq
%scf_etol 1e-10
%scf_maxiter 300
%mult    3
%spin    unrestricted
%smearing gauss
%smearing_sigma 0.15
%smearing_moment relaxed
*geometry angstrom
 O   0.000000    0.000000    0.000000
 O   0.000000    0.000000    1.300000
*end
